+    // the bot's center traces an "air" path — so the bot snags on corners,
+    // ends up off-grid, and pathfinder oscillates. Forcing the move to go
+    // cardinal (two axis-aligned steps) keeps the bot grid-aligned and
+    // prevents the stuck-on-corner failure mode entirely.
+    if (blockC1.physical || blockB1.physical || blockC2.physical || blockB2.physical) return
